*.log
node_modules/
formal/*_TTrace_*.tla
formal/*_TTrace_*.bin
formal/states/
formal/tools/

# TLC model-checker scratch: binary state queues/checkpoints written into
# the CWD by tla2tools. Regenerated by every run; never source. Anchored to
# the two directories TLC is actually invoked from - a bare `states/` would
# ignore any directory of that name anywhere in the tree, which is a quiet
# way to lose a real source folder later.
/states/
/formal/states/
